WEBVTT

00:07.000 --> 00:07.720
‪YIZHOU

00:07.800 --> 00:10.880
Yizhou holds Brocade Weaving Competition

00:10.960 --> 00:12.080
on the ninth day of the tenth month.

00:46.560 --> 00:48.080
The craft of Shu brocade
began in the Spring and Autumn era

00:48.160 --> 00:49.520
and flourished greatly
in the Han and Tang dynasties.

00:50.080 --> 00:52.440
It takes its name from its birthplace,
the land of Shu.

00:52.520 --> 00:53.520
During the Tang dynasty,

00:53.600 --> 00:56.120
Shu brocade was greatly prized by nobles
and prosperous merchants alike.

00:56.200 --> 00:58.200
It was even used as currency
within the military…

00:58.280 --> 00:59.320
DEITY TABLET OF LEIZHU

00:59.400 --> 01:01.600
…and for a time,
its value rose to extraordinary heights.

01:02.120 --> 01:04.200
An inch of Shu brocade
holds the worth of pure gold.

01:05.200 --> 01:06.040
My father

01:06.120 --> 01:08.640
is renowned as the finest brocade artisan
in all of Yizhou.

01:08.720 --> 01:10.600
It was he who crafted
the most exquisite shade of red

01:10.680 --> 01:11.680
ever seen in Shu.

01:11.760 --> 01:12.640
DYEING PROCESS

01:12.720 --> 01:14.640
He devoted himself
to mastering the art of dyeing,

01:14.720 --> 01:15.920
experimenting tirelessly
to perfect his hues.

01:16.000 --> 01:18.200
Every step of the process, he insisted
upon overseeing with his own eyes.

01:18.280 --> 01:19.200
He often said that

01:19.280 --> 01:21.920
to attain the richest
and most vivid colors,

01:22.000 --> 01:24.520
the silk must be washed
in the pure waters of Huanhua Creek.

01:27.400 --> 01:29.800
PATTERN TRANSFER

01:33.120 --> 01:35.520
DRAWING MOTIFS

01:37.240 --> 01:39.200
PATTERN SELECTION AND BASE TYING

01:39.280 --> 01:40.720
WEFT INSERTION

01:41.280 --> 01:43.960
It was the most breathtaking red silk
I had ever seen.

01:44.480 --> 01:47.800
It was bold, radiant,
and alive with brilliance.

01:48.480 --> 01:49.400
Father named it…

01:49.480 --> 01:50.320
JI

01:50.400 --> 01:52.240
…Shu Red Silk.

01:52.320 --> 01:55.360
SHU RED SILK, JI GUINAN

01:55.960 --> 01:57.040
But the silk…

01:57.760 --> 01:58.840
It was too beautiful.

01:58.920 --> 01:59.800
That's my father!

01:59.880 --> 02:01.840
My father became the Brocade Master.

02:01.920 --> 02:03.560
My father became the Brocade Master!

02:03.640 --> 02:06.040
And with its beauty came trouble.

02:07.160 --> 02:08.120
Ji Guinan,

02:08.720 --> 02:10.320
how dare you

02:10.400 --> 02:14.280
present such shoddy brocade
as imperial tribute!

02:15.280 --> 02:16.240
Mr. Liu,

02:16.320 --> 02:18.240
we both inspected the boxes together
that day.

02:18.320 --> 02:20.040
I personally examined each one,

02:20.120 --> 02:21.560
and there was no doubt they were genuine.

02:22.320 --> 02:24.680
Yet after being entrusted
to the logistics officer,

02:24.760 --> 02:26.880
they mysteriously turned into
counterfeit goods overnight at the inn.

02:27.400 --> 02:29.280
There is certainly
something foul afoot here.

02:29.360 --> 02:30.480
How insolent!

02:30.560 --> 02:33.280
Are you insinuating that
the logistics officer stole the brocade?

02:33.360 --> 02:34.800
- Guards!
- Yes, sir!

02:34.880 --> 02:36.520
- Take him away!
- Wait!

02:37.480 --> 02:38.560
Your position

02:39.080 --> 02:40.800
grants you no authority
to imprison anyone!

02:42.720 --> 02:45.480
I demand to see the governor
and prove my innocence!

03:20.280 --> 03:21.800
Don't be afraid.

03:22.640 --> 03:23.680
Don't…

03:30.200 --> 03:31.520
Father!

03:38.360 --> 03:39.640
Ji Guinan

03:39.720 --> 03:41.000
is hereby sentenced to immediate execution

03:41.080 --> 03:42.200
for presenting inferior goods as tribute,

03:42.280 --> 03:43.400
deceiving the emperor,

03:43.480 --> 03:44.880
and resisting arrest!

03:44.960 --> 03:46.640
LOGISTICS OFFICER

03:48.440 --> 03:49.360
Yes, sir!

03:53.960 --> 03:55.320
Ji Guinan

03:55.400 --> 03:57.120
has been executed

03:57.200 --> 03:58.920
by the logistics officer

03:59.000 --> 04:00.160
for passing off inferior goods as tribute,

04:00.840 --> 04:02.240
deceiving the emperor,

04:02.320 --> 04:04.080
and resisting arrest!

04:04.960 --> 04:07.080
Seize all

04:07.160 --> 04:08.320
of the Ji family's assets.

04:08.400 --> 04:09.680
Search everywhere!

04:09.760 --> 04:10.720
Yes, sir!

04:19.720 --> 04:21.800
A rabbit cannot slay a tiger
with a single bite,

04:22.920 --> 04:24.560
but so long as it remains unseen,

04:25.160 --> 04:26.360
it can keep gnawing.

04:26.440 --> 04:27.280
YOUNG YANG JINGLAN

04:28.240 --> 04:29.280
One day,

04:29.800 --> 04:31.320
it shall bring down the tiger.

04:52.880 --> 04:54.000
YOUNG JI YAOTING, MRS. JI

04:56.320 --> 04:58.160
JI GUI

05:06.600 --> 05:07.480
Report!

05:11.440 --> 05:12.800
We have discovered a robe of Shu Red Silk.

05:12.880 --> 05:14.640
It is most likely a gift from the palace.

05:14.720 --> 05:16.240
That's mine!

05:16.320 --> 05:17.800
My father left it to me!

05:17.880 --> 05:19.280
- Let go!
- Yingying!

05:19.360 --> 05:21.040
- Let go, Yingying!
- Let go!

05:21.120 --> 05:22.440
- Hey!
- Let go!

05:22.520 --> 05:23.400
Father said that

05:23.480 --> 05:24.800
- silk could always be rewoven,
- Let go!

05:24.880 --> 05:27.000
but if you are gone as well,
then all shall truly be lost!

05:27.080 --> 05:28.080
I said, let go!

05:30.200 --> 05:31.600
Yingying!

06:18.320 --> 06:19.400
- Yingying.
- You can't go!

06:20.320 --> 06:21.360
Yingying!

06:22.160 --> 06:24.920
- Yingying.
- Xiuyuan, you can't go!

06:25.000 --> 06:25.920
Father,

06:26.000 --> 06:27.160
please save the Ji family.

06:28.280 --> 06:29.800
What do you know, child?

06:29.880 --> 06:30.840
Please!

06:30.920 --> 06:31.840
Let's go home.

06:31.920 --> 06:33.040
Let's go!

06:58.800 --> 07:01.600
SANDAOYAN

07:02.200 --> 07:04.640
FIVE MONTHS LATER

07:07.960 --> 07:10.320
This place may be a bit run-down,

07:11.040 --> 07:13.560
but it's the best house I could find.

07:14.160 --> 07:16.240
Mr. Zhao, you are most gracious.

07:16.880 --> 07:17.800
The Ji family

07:18.320 --> 07:19.920
shall repay you the sum
at the earliest opportunity.

07:20.000 --> 07:21.480
There is no need for haste

07:21.560 --> 07:22.600
in repaying the sum.

07:23.120 --> 07:25.880
You, Yingying, and Yaoting
have been granted amnesty.

07:25.960 --> 07:27.840
This marks a new beginning.

07:27.920 --> 07:29.920
From here on, all will get better.

07:31.480 --> 07:33.200
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

07:33.960 --> 07:37.760
JI GUINAN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

07:38.360 --> 07:39.320
Guinan,

07:40.880 --> 07:42.080
we have returned home.

07:43.160 --> 07:44.960
Do not worry, Father.

07:45.600 --> 07:48.480
From this day forth, Yaoting and I
will be good and obedient to Mother.

07:56.880 --> 07:57.840
Mrs. Ji,

07:57.920 --> 07:59.280
now that you have returned,

07:59.360 --> 08:01.120
we kindly ask that you come out
to meet us.

08:02.720 --> 08:07.080
Mrs. Ji, how about settling the debts?

08:08.360 --> 08:09.280
Everyone,

08:09.800 --> 08:12.440
the Ji family will repay the money.

08:12.520 --> 08:13.840
However,

08:13.920 --> 08:15.120
with our assets having been seized,

08:15.200 --> 08:16.680
we are left with nothing.

08:17.200 --> 08:19.640
Please give us a little more time.

08:19.720 --> 08:22.840
I have thought of a solution for you.

08:23.520 --> 08:26.480
I have already discussed it
with the other creditors.

08:26.560 --> 08:28.080
If you give me

08:28.160 --> 08:31.080
the formula for Shu Red Silk,

08:31.160 --> 08:32.760
we will write off

08:32.840 --> 08:33.960
all your debts,

08:34.039 --> 08:35.799
and I will even settle what you owe

08:35.880 --> 08:37.240
to the others.

08:37.320 --> 08:38.720
My father was convicted,

08:38.799 --> 08:40.440
and all that we had was stripped away.

08:40.520 --> 08:42.840
- Formula for Shu Red Silk wasn't there.
- Ting!

08:42.919 --> 08:44.720
When my father was alive,

08:44.800 --> 08:46.040
he treated you all with generosity.

08:46.120 --> 08:48.280
Yet now you place such pressure upon us.

08:48.360 --> 08:50.560
If this were to be made known,
do you not fear for your reputation?

08:51.520 --> 08:53.400
Can reputation fill our stomachs?

08:54.000 --> 08:55.600
Either settle the debt

08:56.120 --> 08:58.040
or surrender the formula.

08:58.680 --> 09:00.440
I, Zhao Xiuyuan,
am willing to act as their guarantor.

09:00.960 --> 09:03.120
Might you allow us some more time?

09:03.640 --> 09:06.040
We are here to collect debts
owed by the Ji family.

09:06.640 --> 09:08.640
What business is it of yours,
an outsider, to interfere?

09:10.320 --> 09:11.360
Mr. Zhao!

09:12.520 --> 09:14.480
If you are unable to repay the debts,

09:15.400 --> 09:16.440
then perhaps you should sell yourselves

09:16.960 --> 09:18.880
to settle the matter.

09:19.720 --> 09:20.640
Take them away!

09:21.840 --> 09:22.680
What are you doing?

09:22.760 --> 09:24.560
- Hey, what are you doing?
- No!

09:24.640 --> 09:26.440
- What are you doing? Stop!
- Let go of me!

09:26.520 --> 09:28.520
- Let go of me!
- Hey!

09:28.600 --> 09:29.640
Let go!

09:31.560 --> 09:32.400
Stop!

09:32.480 --> 09:34.040
- Mother!
- Mother!

09:34.640 --> 09:35.960
Stop!

09:36.040 --> 09:38.400
Since you refused to provide us a way out,

09:38.480 --> 09:39.440
we may as well end our lives

09:39.520 --> 09:41.280
- here and now.
- Mother.

09:41.360 --> 09:43.320
Let the public witness

09:43.400 --> 09:46.160
your cruelty toward a widow
and her children.

09:46.240 --> 09:48.280
We shall see who will be bold enough
to do business with you after today.

09:48.360 --> 09:50.960
Right.

09:51.040 --> 09:52.160
That's right!

09:52.240 --> 09:54.160
That's right.

09:58.080 --> 10:00.720
Very well. I shall desist for now.

10:01.520 --> 10:02.920
The sum shall be treated

10:03.000 --> 10:04.920
as a loan,

10:05.000 --> 10:06.960
with interest set at 5%.

10:07.520 --> 10:08.880
From here on,

10:08.960 --> 10:10.840
the interest must be paid annually.

10:11.520 --> 10:13.120
Should you miss even one payment,

10:15.360 --> 10:17.040
do not blame us for taking the matter
to the authorities

10:17.640 --> 10:20.880
and having you sell yourselves
in repayment.

10:21.560 --> 10:22.400
Let's go!

10:28.480 --> 10:30.360
- Mother?
- Mother!

10:30.440 --> 10:31.880
- Mother!
- Mother!

10:31.960 --> 10:33.280
- Mother.
- Mother, are you okay?

10:33.360 --> 10:35.040
- Mother?
- Mother!

10:35.120 --> 10:36.200
I'm fine.

10:36.280 --> 10:37.560
I'm really fine.

10:37.640 --> 10:38.960
Are you hurt?

10:39.040 --> 10:40.560
- No.
- No.

10:40.640 --> 10:42.120
- We're okay, Mother.
- No.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.520
That's good.

10:43.600 --> 10:45.040
That's really good.

10:45.120 --> 10:46.520
That's good.

10:49.160 --> 10:50.160
Mother,

10:50.760 --> 10:52.920
let me help you back inside
so you may rest.

10:54.200 --> 10:55.040
Okay.

11:17.720 --> 11:19.680
With the departure of the cold winter,

11:19.760 --> 11:21.360
the first yellow buds of spring
begin to bloom.

11:21.880 --> 11:22.760
Yingying,

11:22.840 --> 11:25.320
I hope that all misfortune is left behind
and that you may start anew.

11:41.440 --> 11:44.000
EIGHT YEARS LATER
HUANHUA CREEK

11:47.920 --> 11:49.560
AT THE FAR WEST OF HUANHUA CREEK,

11:49.640 --> 11:51.240
ONE FINDS SOLITUDE
AMIDST THE LUSH GREENERY

12:18.360 --> 12:21.520
JI YINGYING

12:38.840 --> 12:40.520
MR. CHEN, YINGXI DYEHOUSE

12:41.520 --> 12:43.960
MR. SHENG, CAILUAN DYEHOUSE

12:48.880 --> 12:52.000
Time to wash the silk!

12:56.680 --> 12:58.000
MS. ZHU, KNOWN AS PIN
DAUGHTER OF LUOXIA DYEHOUSE

13:16.120 --> 13:18.080
The Hua family is here! Run!

13:18.160 --> 13:19.960
- Hurry, pack up!
- Quick!

13:20.040 --> 13:20.880
No one else is permitted here

13:20.960 --> 13:22.080
when the Hua family
wants to wash their silk.

13:22.160 --> 13:23.480
They are far too overbearing!

13:24.000 --> 13:24.840
They have a large dyehouse.
You can't cross them.

13:24.920 --> 13:26.920
Ms. Zhu, help me gather that. Quick!

13:27.000 --> 13:28.400
I'll distract them.

13:28.480 --> 13:29.600
Help me, Yingying!

13:29.680 --> 13:30.880
Thank you!

13:30.960 --> 13:32.000
Hurry! Let's go!

13:37.120 --> 13:38.480
Mr. Hua,

13:38.560 --> 13:39.680
what brings you here?

13:39.760 --> 13:41.000
Surely, you wouldn't want the sun

13:41.080 --> 13:43.160
to rob you of your charm by tanning you,
would you?

13:43.760 --> 13:46.520
I have come to see

13:46.600 --> 13:49.960
if anyone dares to wash silk
on my family's land without permission.

13:50.880 --> 13:52.160
Do you feel the heat?

13:52.240 --> 13:54.000
Why exert yourself
in this sweltering weather

13:54.080 --> 13:54.920
by coming here?

13:55.000 --> 13:56.520
Move aside!

14:02.080 --> 14:03.320
The Ji family
has recently made a delivery.

14:03.400 --> 14:04.480
Mr. Hua, perhaps you should go
and inspect that instead?

14:04.560 --> 14:05.760
What is there to inspect?

14:05.840 --> 14:07.080
My remarkable wife

14:07.160 --> 14:09.400
oversees all the business matters

14:09.480 --> 14:10.640
flawlessly.

14:11.280 --> 14:12.160
That is certainly the case.

14:12.240 --> 14:13.920
Your wife is the one who oversees
all the decisions in your household.

14:20.440 --> 14:22.520
Ji Yingying,
are you deliberately obstructing me?

14:22.600 --> 14:23.840
Why would I?

14:23.920 --> 14:25.720
I'm just holding the umbrella for you,

14:25.800 --> 14:27.680
so, naturally, I'll go wherever you go.

14:27.760 --> 14:29.360
Oh? So, now you follow me wherever I go,

14:29.440 --> 14:30.720
is that it?

14:30.800 --> 14:32.000
Hand it over! Move aside!

14:46.360 --> 14:49.040
You brats are fortunate
to escape unscathed today!

14:49.120 --> 14:52.840
Should anyone dare to sneak in
to wash silk during the day again,

14:53.720 --> 14:55.280
I will have their legs broken!

14:57.000 --> 14:59.040
That's right…!

15:01.000 --> 15:02.960
Ji Yingying, what are you doing here?

15:04.200 --> 15:05.440
I'm just passing through.

15:05.520 --> 15:07.000
I'll be on my way. Excuse me.

15:28.520 --> 15:30.400
It is prohibited to ride horses
at Huanhua Creek!

15:30.480 --> 15:31.960
A fine steed and a fair lady.

15:32.040 --> 15:33.120
Such a beautiful day too.

15:33.720 --> 15:36.160
Would the fair young lady grace me
with her company for a ride?

15:41.440 --> 15:42.280
You gave me quite a fright!

15:42.360 --> 15:43.760
Goodness,

15:43.840 --> 15:45.120
I very nearly fell.

15:47.160 --> 15:48.840
You're so beautiful.

15:49.440 --> 15:51.480
Allow me to take you to the city
for a bit of merriment.

15:52.320 --> 15:53.840
- Scoundrel.
- Thug. Quick, run!

15:53.920 --> 15:55.080
Yingying!

15:56.600 --> 15:58.920
Hurry…! They are harassing her.

15:59.440 --> 16:02.720
How dare you come to Sandaoyan
to harass the ladies?

16:03.240 --> 16:05.640
It seems to me you have

16:05.720 --> 16:07.880
no fear of death!

16:07.960 --> 16:09.160
That's right…!

16:09.240 --> 16:11.360
Did you just threaten me?

16:11.440 --> 16:13.440
Do you know who you are speaking to?
How dare you speak to me in this way!

16:13.520 --> 16:15.440
- Listen here.
- I'll hit whoever I please.

16:15.520 --> 16:17.120
Why should I care who you are?

16:17.200 --> 16:18.720
Hit him!

16:34.800 --> 16:36.440
YANG JINGLAN

16:36.520 --> 16:39.720
Mr. Yang, out of kindness, I invited you
to join me in seeing such beauties.

16:39.800 --> 16:41.000
Why did you repay me with a kick?

16:41.080 --> 16:42.800
Touch my horse one more time,

16:43.320 --> 16:44.320
and I'll make sure you meet a watery end.

16:44.400 --> 16:46.240
It was merely a ride.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.440
You… Yes.

16:47.520 --> 16:49.240
They hit your horse. That one…!

16:49.320 --> 16:51.600
The lady in pink. She is their leader.

16:53.880 --> 16:55.000
You missed.

17:07.119 --> 17:08.160
Is this yours?

17:10.200 --> 17:11.839
Thank you for picking up my flower.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.640
Had I not arrived in time,

17:14.720 --> 17:16.680
- he would have died here.
- That's right!

17:16.760 --> 17:18.880
He was the one
who harassed the ladies first.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.720
If I hadn't intervened,

17:20.800 --> 17:22.000
he would have ended up in jail.

17:23.560 --> 17:25.599
If that's the case,
he certainly deserves to get hit.

17:26.359 --> 17:28.160
What, Mr. Yang?
Why are you siding with outsiders?

17:29.240 --> 17:30.440
Yet,

17:30.520 --> 17:32.680
it was you lot who hit my horse.

17:33.920 --> 17:35.240
That's right.

17:35.320 --> 17:36.320
I'm sorry.

17:36.400 --> 17:38.600
It never mentioned that
it was your horse when we hit it.

17:39.200 --> 17:41.000
Horses can't speak, after all.

17:41.080 --> 17:43.880
We wouldn't have done it
if it had told us it belonged to you.

17:43.960 --> 17:45.560
- Exactly.
- Exactly.

17:51.600 --> 17:54.160
- Yingying,
- what are you doing?

17:54.680 --> 17:56.280
With your way with words, miss,

17:56.360 --> 17:57.800
I wonder if you could teach

17:57.880 --> 17:59.040
my horse to talk.

18:03.560 --> 18:05.000
Put her down!

18:05.080 --> 18:06.440
- Put her down!
- Now!

18:13.720 --> 18:15.360
I can't teach horses to speak,

18:15.440 --> 18:17.440
but I certainly can teach humans.

18:19.280 --> 18:20.840
Humans have self-control,

18:21.440 --> 18:23.520
but horses do not.

18:24.880 --> 18:26.800
If you're going to hit someone,
stay away from the horses.

18:26.880 --> 18:29.400
I won't always arrive in time.

18:36.280 --> 18:37.560
Next time?

18:37.640 --> 18:39.440
Well, that will depend on
who is the rider.

18:39.520 --> 18:40.680
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

18:44.280 --> 18:45.360
My silk.

18:54.760 --> 18:58.200
HUANHUA DYEING WORKSHOP

18:59.480 --> 19:01.360
Life is what I seek

19:01.440 --> 19:03.720
And righteousness is also my desire

19:03.800 --> 19:05.480
Yet, these two cannot coexist

19:05.560 --> 19:07.320
One must forsake life for righteousness

19:07.400 --> 19:08.240
JI YAOTING, JI YIYING'S BROTHER

19:14.240 --> 19:16.080
This is all we have left at home.

19:17.120 --> 19:18.320
Just make do for now.

19:22.120 --> 19:23.960
A true gentleman does not seek indulgence.

19:24.040 --> 19:26.080
Guo Kui, even if you're a dog,

19:26.160 --> 19:28.960
there are rules to follow.

19:29.040 --> 19:30.440
To be a gentleman is to not be

19:30.520 --> 19:31.960
overly driven by desire for indulgence.

19:34.040 --> 19:36.080
I'll beat you up
if you're being picky! Eat!

19:38.520 --> 19:41.560
Yingying, why are you in such a bad mood?

19:41.640 --> 19:42.880
Who did you argue with?

19:43.400 --> 19:45.320
No one. I was just in a fight.

19:47.280 --> 19:49.280
- With whom?
- I don't know.

19:49.800 --> 19:52.080
They dress in fine clothes,

19:52.160 --> 19:54.080
but they have no idea who I am.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.920
Yaoting, we've talked about it before.
Stick to the old rule.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.600
If no one comes looking for us,
act like nothing happened.

19:58.680 --> 20:00.480
If someone does, take Mother for a walk.

20:01.080 --> 20:01.920
Mr. Ji.

20:02.960 --> 20:03.840
Ms. Ji.

20:04.360 --> 20:05.320
Mrs. Hua is here.

20:05.920 --> 20:07.400
Yaoting, don't worry. I'll see her.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.760
I'll hold her off.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.440
Give me.

20:18.480 --> 20:19.680
Mrs. Hua,

20:19.760 --> 20:21.840
the silk you ordered are all here.

20:21.920 --> 20:23.000
Kindly check the numbers.

20:23.080 --> 20:24.920
HUARONG, THE OWNER OF HUA'S DYEHOUSE

20:25.000 --> 20:27.520
The color is dull, lacking vibrancy,

20:28.240 --> 20:29.960
and it doesn't have the luster it should.

20:30.680 --> 20:33.880
It doesn't feel smooth either.

20:36.440 --> 20:38.320
Mrs. Hua, take a closer look.

20:38.400 --> 20:40.720
This is the finest mulberry silk
of Jiannandao,

20:40.800 --> 20:42.760
with a consistent texture
and a soft luster.

20:42.840 --> 20:44.720
The color is far more vibrant
than anything else on the market.

20:44.800 --> 20:45.840
Mr. Ji,

20:45.920 --> 20:48.000
I'll be honest with you.

20:48.080 --> 20:50.480
Business has been tough lately.

20:51.360 --> 20:54.400
A few of the major brocade merchants
in Yizhou have been undercutting prices.

20:54.480 --> 20:56.080
If this continues,

20:56.160 --> 20:58.480
I won't be able
to afford your silk anymore.

20:59.160 --> 21:00.600
Trust is the foundation of everything.

21:00.680 --> 21:03.160
Since we've made an agreement,
we should honor it.

21:03.240 --> 21:04.720
That may be your business practice,

21:05.680 --> 21:06.840
but my practice

21:06.920 --> 21:08.000
is to buy it

21:08.520 --> 21:09.720
at five-tenths.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.880
If you don't want to sell,
that's your choice.

21:11.960 --> 21:15.320
I'll pay you at the original price
for this order,

21:16.560 --> 21:18.800
but don't expect any more orders

21:18.880 --> 21:20.280
from me after this.

21:21.400 --> 21:23.600
Mrs. Hua,
you're aware of my family's situation.

21:23.680 --> 21:25.360
We have to pay you annual interest,

21:25.440 --> 21:26.360
and on top of that, my mother is ill.

21:26.440 --> 21:28.520
Her medicine requires a lot of money.

21:29.360 --> 21:30.360
What about this?

21:30.880 --> 21:32.760
If you're truly in need of money,

21:33.280 --> 21:34.520
I can lend you 20 guan.

21:34.600 --> 21:36.560
We already owe you money.

21:36.640 --> 21:38.280
If we borrow more… how…

21:38.360 --> 21:40.360
How could we ever manage
to pay off what we owe?

21:40.440 --> 21:41.400
Yaoting,

21:42.760 --> 21:44.400
Mrs. Hua is joking.

21:44.480 --> 21:46.400
She won't lend us money anymore.

21:49.080 --> 21:50.280
Mrs. Hua.

21:51.480 --> 21:52.720
Why wouldn't she?

21:54.040 --> 21:55.200
Yaoting, think about it.

21:55.280 --> 21:57.320
We already owe her 50 guan.

21:57.400 --> 22:01.160
If we borrow another 20 guan,
the 3% interest alone exceeds

22:01.240 --> 22:03.200
our family's annual profit.

22:03.280 --> 22:04.600
If we can't pay her,

22:04.680 --> 22:06.680
our family will end up
as servants to the Hua family.

22:07.600 --> 22:08.440
But Mrs. Hua

22:09.800 --> 22:12.400
is generous, beautiful, and kind.

22:12.480 --> 22:14.000
She wouldn't force us to sell ourselves,

22:14.080 --> 22:16.120
so, of course, she wouldn't lend us money,

22:16.200 --> 22:17.200
right, Mrs. Hua?

22:18.840 --> 22:19.720
Alright then.

22:20.240 --> 22:22.200
Since your family doesn't need the money,

22:23.120 --> 22:25.040
I'll adjust this order
to four-tenths of the price.

22:25.120 --> 22:26.400
Mrs. Hua.

22:26.480 --> 22:27.760
Alright.

22:27.840 --> 22:30.240
We'll adjust the order as requested,
Mrs. Hua.

22:30.760 --> 22:31.760
This way, please.

22:38.520 --> 22:41.680
Mrs. Hua, the pen and paper are all set.
You can start.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.800
Ji Yingying,

22:46.880 --> 22:49.000
I knew that you were up to no good!

22:49.080 --> 22:51.120
- Come in here! Come!
- Shh!

22:51.200 --> 22:53.800
Our dog can't tolerate shouting.

22:53.880 --> 22:55.600
The louder you get, the faster
it will sink its teeth into you.

22:56.480 --> 22:57.600
I'm warning you.

22:57.680 --> 22:59.360
If you deliberately hurt me,

22:59.440 --> 23:00.320
you'll find yourself behind bars!

23:01.560 --> 23:03.160
I'm warning you.
If you deliberately hurt her,

23:03.240 --> 23:04.080
you'll find yourself behind bars!

23:06.800 --> 23:09.080
It said the food in prison
is better than at home.

23:09.160 --> 23:10.280
Oh dear!

23:11.080 --> 23:12.040
It's actually willing to go to jail.

23:13.680 --> 23:15.120
What do you want from me

23:16.080 --> 23:17.000
for you send the dog away?

23:18.240 --> 23:19.160
You know it.

23:22.160 --> 23:24.440
- Five-tenths.
- Tao Yuanming said

23:24.520 --> 23:25.640
not to yield
to a simple five-tenths discount.

23:25.720 --> 23:27.120
That's five packets of rice!

23:27.200 --> 23:28.240
Did you even know that?

23:32.760 --> 23:34.760
Six-tenths. Only six-tenths at most!

23:36.920 --> 23:38.880
It said six-tenths isn't even enough
to buy its meat.

23:38.960 --> 23:40.240
It still wants to go to jail.

23:43.120 --> 23:45.320
Seven-tenths! Seven-tenths at most!

23:53.000 --> 23:54.160
You should have said that earlier.

23:54.240 --> 23:55.520
Deal!

23:55.600 --> 23:57.120
Kindly sign here.

24:01.800 --> 24:02.960
Thank you for your patronage.

24:03.040 --> 24:05.400
Guo Kui, see our guests off!

24:07.960 --> 24:09.000
CONTRACTING PARTIES
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE, HUA'S DYEHOUSE

24:12.480 --> 24:15.320
Yingying, I know Mrs. Hua is doing this

24:15.400 --> 24:17.120
to force us
to become her servants forever.

24:17.200 --> 24:19.360
What will we do if she refuses to buy

24:19.440 --> 24:21.280
our family's silk

24:21.360 --> 24:22.320
after how you treated her today?

24:22.840 --> 24:24.160
We dyed our silks well.

24:24.240 --> 24:25.960
A three-tenths discount won't hurt her.

24:26.040 --> 24:27.560
She can be angry,

24:27.640 --> 24:28.680
but she's a businesswoman.

24:28.760 --> 24:30.000
Profit always comes first.

24:30.080 --> 24:31.320
Father always said,

24:31.400 --> 24:33.600
a lasting business is built
when we win people over with virtue.

24:33.680 --> 24:34.720
Father also always said

24:34.800 --> 24:36.800
to reason with reasonable people.

24:37.360 --> 24:38.640
Yaoting, didn't we discuss this?

24:38.720 --> 24:40.440
You handle what's been done,
and I'll take care of what's to come.

24:40.520 --> 24:41.960
Alright…

24:42.040 --> 24:43.120
Mrs. Ji,

24:43.200 --> 24:45.680
I heard you daughter got into a fight
at Huanhua Creek.

24:55.560 --> 24:58.040
Ting, fetch my cane.

24:58.640 --> 25:00.120
- Don't go.
- Mother.

25:00.200 --> 25:01.280
Go now!

25:02.280 --> 25:03.560
You are on your own.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.920
No way.

25:05.000 --> 25:05.880
Ji Yingying, stand there!

25:05.960 --> 25:07.120
Let's die together.

25:20.840 --> 25:23.120
- Mother.
- She's not mute.

25:23.200 --> 25:24.560
You don't need to defend her.

25:32.560 --> 25:35.680
Mother, I was wrong.

25:36.200 --> 25:37.760
Why don't you punish me?

25:37.840 --> 25:39.360
The physician has spoken
of your condition.

25:39.440 --> 25:41.320
How many times have I told you?

25:41.840 --> 25:44.320
Acting recklessly and aggressively

25:44.400 --> 25:45.880
will only ruin your reputation.

25:49.080 --> 25:50.040
Tell me.

25:50.680 --> 25:52.600
Do you have the grace
of a noble lady at all?

25:54.480 --> 25:55.880
Ji Yingying.

25:57.080 --> 25:58.040
Mother.

25:58.560 --> 25:59.720
Mother…

25:59.800 --> 26:02.480
I'm hungry. My stomach is growling.

26:02.560 --> 26:04.000
I'm so hungry.

26:04.080 --> 26:05.360
I know I've made a mistake.

26:05.440 --> 26:07.160
Please forgive me.

26:07.240 --> 26:09.600
Alright. Sit down and eat.

26:10.640 --> 26:13.040
I know that you love me most, Mother.

26:21.040 --> 26:22.440
I've been thinking

26:22.960 --> 26:25.440
about how Mrs. Hua has been collecting

26:25.520 --> 26:27.680
our debts for the past eight years.

26:28.720 --> 26:31.120
She's still our only creditor to this day.

26:32.280 --> 26:35.160
I think she has other motives.

26:35.240 --> 26:37.120
Have you had enough yet?

26:37.640 --> 26:40.640
Let your brother worry about this.

26:41.160 --> 26:42.520
You're all grown up.

26:42.600 --> 26:44.520
You can't keep acting like you did before.

26:44.600 --> 26:47.720
You also have an engagement with Mr. Zhao.

26:48.240 --> 26:51.040
Mr. Zhao has been generous
to our family over the years.

26:51.120 --> 26:52.600
Don't put him in a difficult position.

26:52.680 --> 26:54.600
Yaoting isn't married yet.
I'm not in a hurry.

26:58.160 --> 27:00.800
You cannot refuse what is offered
by elders.

27:09.800 --> 27:10.800
- Ting.
- I will not marry

27:10.880 --> 27:14.000
until I have cleared our debts
and restored our family's honor.

27:14.680 --> 27:15.880
How resolute!

27:18.640 --> 27:20.880
I'm younger, so don't refuse it.

27:26.320 --> 27:27.360
When Heaven bestows great responsibility
upon someone,

27:27.440 --> 27:29.160
it first tempers their mind and body

27:29.240 --> 27:31.400
through hardships to fortify

27:31.480 --> 27:33.440
- their character.
- Enough…

27:34.200 --> 27:36.160
Ji Yingying, tell me.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.600
Who did you fight with today?

27:40.600 --> 27:42.640
Mother, I didn't fight with anyone today.

27:42.720 --> 27:45.440
Actually,
it's because of Huanhua Dyehouse,

27:45.520 --> 27:47.040
Yingxia Dyehouse,

27:47.120 --> 27:49.520
and several other dyehouses.

27:50.120 --> 27:51.200
There are just

27:52.320 --> 27:55.400
some… I'm not entirely sure either.

27:55.480 --> 27:56.440
Guo Kui hasn't eaten yet.

27:56.520 --> 27:58.400
I have to make its dinner.

27:58.480 --> 27:59.600
- Ji Yingying!
- Guo Kui!

27:59.680 --> 28:00.880
You…!

28:00.960 --> 28:02.880
- Time to eat, Guo Kui!
- This child.

28:03.400 --> 28:04.720
Ting,

28:04.800 --> 28:06.560
do you know who she fought with today?

28:06.640 --> 28:07.960
I do not.

28:08.040 --> 28:10.240
Find out about it tomorrow,

28:10.320 --> 28:12.520
and make sure
to apologize to them properly.

28:14.200 --> 28:15.360
Mother,

28:15.440 --> 28:16.760
Yingying isn't the quiet or gentle type,

28:16.840 --> 28:18.880
but she wouldn't cause trouble
without reason.

28:18.960 --> 28:19.880
This matter feels…

28:21.080 --> 28:22.640
Does it even matter who's right or wrong?

28:22.720 --> 28:24.520
Do you not understand too?

28:24.600 --> 28:25.800
I do…

28:26.800 --> 28:28.880
I no longer desire luxurious things.

28:29.400 --> 28:30.920
All I wish for is for both of you

28:31.000 --> 28:32.680
to live in peace.

28:35.280 --> 28:36.640
Yes, Mother.

28:37.840 --> 28:38.920
Please don't be upset.

28:40.720 --> 28:41.840
Eat your food.

28:41.920 --> 28:43.280
I'll go tomorrow.

28:56.400 --> 28:57.680
Mr. Yang,

28:58.200 --> 28:59.920
I know

29:00.440 --> 29:01.480
I've failed you.

29:01.560 --> 29:04.320
You trusted me

29:04.400 --> 29:06.360
with looking after your mentor,

29:06.880 --> 29:08.640
but he's gone now.

29:09.960 --> 29:12.560
Three brocade officers have died

29:13.240 --> 29:14.720
in Yizhou alone.

29:16.360 --> 29:18.920
He could have chosen any path.
Why choose to be a brocade officer?

29:19.000 --> 29:19.840
I don't…

29:19.920 --> 29:22.160
What was it that he wanted you
to pass on to me?

29:26.000 --> 29:27.120
He told me

29:27.640 --> 29:29.920
to pass this on to you

29:30.000 --> 29:31.480
when I saw you again.

29:34.960 --> 29:37.520
This is your best friend in Yizhou.

29:37.600 --> 29:38.800
What is so good about him?

29:38.880 --> 29:40.080
He trusts me.

29:40.680 --> 29:41.520
ZHU GEHONG

29:41.600 --> 29:44.440
What message did Mr. Shen
leave for you then?

29:44.520 --> 29:46.200
Do I have to report to you?

29:47.320 --> 29:48.640
I forgot my place.

29:49.960 --> 29:51.560
What are your plans for tomorrow?

29:51.640 --> 29:53.200
Are you going home or…?

29:54.240 --> 29:55.840
I am meeting a friend.

29:55.920 --> 29:57.880
You have friends in Yizhou?

30:08.720 --> 30:10.240
The messenger only mentioned that

30:10.320 --> 30:11.840
soldiers surrounded your house.

30:11.920 --> 30:12.800
Perhaps there is a misunderstanding.

30:19.160 --> 30:20.960
- You again?
- It's you!

30:21.480 --> 30:23.320
Something urgent came up at home!

30:23.400 --> 30:25.040
Please give me a lift.

30:35.760 --> 30:38.280
If my family makes it through this crisis,

30:38.960 --> 30:40.880
I'll be your friend.

30:51.280 --> 30:52.560
A future friend!

31:02.840 --> 31:04.440
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

31:04.520 --> 31:05.920
Tell Ji Yingying to come out!

31:08.080 --> 31:09.000
Ji Yingying, show yourself!

31:09.080 --> 31:10.160
- Ms. Ji!
- Ji Yingying, I know you're in there!

31:10.240 --> 31:11.880
Ms. Ji, what should we do now?

31:11.960 --> 31:13.200
- Open up!
- Now I see why

31:13.280 --> 31:15.120
Mrs. Ji asked me
who you were fighting with.

31:15.200 --> 31:16.440
No one knows.

31:16.520 --> 31:18.000
It turns out he wasn't from Sandaoyan.

31:18.080 --> 31:19.720
He's Mr. Sang from Yizhou!

31:20.520 --> 31:21.640
What should we do?

31:21.720 --> 31:23.720
Mrs. Ji and Mr. Ji aren't home right now!

31:23.800 --> 31:25.120
They are out restocking!

31:25.200 --> 31:27.120
Don't worry, Gui. I'm here!

31:28.760 --> 31:31.120
Wait… Ms. Ji, what are you looking for?

31:31.640 --> 31:32.960
I'm looking for a useful tool.

31:33.040 --> 31:34.440
Open up!

31:35.200 --> 31:37.760
- Open up!
- I'm dying!

31:39.760 --> 31:42.200
What's with all the commotion early
in the morning?

31:45.360 --> 31:47.920
So, it turns out Mr. Sang
has honored us with a visit!

31:49.200 --> 31:51.480
Are you scared now? Listen here!

31:51.560 --> 31:53.640
Get on your knees and apologize to me!

31:53.720 --> 31:55.840
I'll spare you this once,
out of generosity.

31:55.920 --> 31:58.280
Thank you for your generosity.

31:58.360 --> 31:59.360
You're truly kind.

31:59.960 --> 32:03.480
But… From head to toe, or left to right,

32:03.560 --> 32:05.440
I don't see any wounds on you?

32:05.520 --> 32:07.240
Look at my leg! My head!

32:07.320 --> 32:10.080
Here! This arm! Here! They're all broken!

32:10.160 --> 32:11.200
Does it hurt?

32:13.640 --> 32:14.840
Ms. Ji!

32:15.360 --> 32:16.240
Did I use too much force?

32:16.320 --> 32:17.200
I don't know.

32:19.000 --> 32:21.400
Gui, I'm bleeding…

32:21.480 --> 32:22.560
You're bleeding!

32:22.640 --> 32:23.640
Bleeding?

32:23.720 --> 32:24.960
I'm bleeding!

32:25.040 --> 32:26.200
Mr. Sang,

32:26.280 --> 32:28.040
Ms. Ji was apologizing earnestly to you!

32:28.120 --> 32:30.200
Aren't you going too far?

32:30.280 --> 32:31.600
Don't blame me!

32:31.680 --> 32:33.040
She hit her head on her own!

32:34.880 --> 32:37.440
I'm an unmarried young woman.

32:37.520 --> 32:39.560
I value my appearance too much
to harm myself.

32:39.640 --> 32:41.680
Why would I ruin myself?

32:41.760 --> 32:43.040
Enough with the accusations!

32:43.120 --> 32:44.600
Listen! Y-You…

32:46.240 --> 32:47.560
Mr. Sang is fine?

32:48.080 --> 32:49.880
How can you be
even more shameless than me?

32:49.960 --> 32:51.440
Do you want me to lock you up?

32:51.520 --> 32:54.600
- You…
- I have a very obvious wound on my head.

32:54.680 --> 32:56.560
Everyone saw it, right?

32:56.640 --> 32:58.200
- Yes!
- We all saw it!

32:58.280 --> 33:00.840
Can you let the officials
check your wounds, then?

33:00.920 --> 33:02.840
- I…
- We can go to the state magistrate

33:02.920 --> 33:04.880
if you want!

33:04.960 --> 33:07.680
I've heard that Chief Sang
is a man of fairness.

33:07.760 --> 33:10.360
I'm sure he'll deliver justice
when he gets back!

33:10.440 --> 33:14.680
GLUTINOUS RICE CAKE

33:15.920 --> 33:17.080
It's okay. Let me see.

33:19.520 --> 33:20.760
It's really her.

33:23.560 --> 33:24.800
That's the friend you mentioned?

33:25.480 --> 33:27.680
Ji Yingying, the daughter
of the Red Silk Brocade Master.

33:28.200 --> 33:29.600
Do you really know her?

33:29.680 --> 33:30.880
Or is this for a case?

33:32.760 --> 33:34.040
No matter the reason,

33:34.560 --> 33:37.440
aren't you going to help her
out of this predicament?

33:38.360 --> 33:40.840
No need. Look.

33:41.360 --> 33:42.520
Her wound is fake,

33:42.600 --> 33:44.400
but her reaction is certainly convincing.

33:47.360 --> 33:48.240
Don't forget,

33:48.760 --> 33:50.920
you've been instructed
to find the Shu Red Silk.

33:52.800 --> 33:55.400
This is the taste I've been after!
I tried making it myself,

33:55.480 --> 33:57.640
but I couldn't get it right. Have a try.

34:17.159 --> 34:19.159
I have made a chance for you.

34:21.960 --> 34:23.120
Mr. Yang?

34:23.199 --> 34:24.760
You've arrived at the perfect moment!
Please come.

34:26.600 --> 34:27.880
Be our judge!

34:27.960 --> 34:30.840
Wasn't it her
who purposely hit her head just now?

34:32.159 --> 34:33.800
I witnessed everything

34:33.880 --> 34:36.080
that happened just now.

34:38.199 --> 34:39.760
I think…

34:40.880 --> 34:42.920
Chief Sang will be back in two days.

34:43.000 --> 34:44.960
I wouldn't cause a scene if I were you.

34:45.040 --> 34:46.120
You'd get a beating.

34:46.199 --> 34:47.840
Why would I get a beating?

34:48.719 --> 34:50.360
Look here. Between you two,

34:50.440 --> 34:52.159
who would your father believe?

34:52.880 --> 34:53.920
But I'm wrapped up like this…

34:54.000 --> 34:55.520
You can trick everyone else,

34:55.600 --> 34:57.720
but you can't fool your father or me.

35:00.000 --> 35:02.240
Fine! Just you wait!

35:02.320 --> 35:03.520
This is not over!

35:04.600 --> 35:06.800
- Let's go!
- Take care, Mr. Sang!

35:17.000 --> 35:17.880
Everyone…

35:17.960 --> 35:19.840
They have already left.

35:20.360 --> 35:21.560
Haven't you seen enough?

35:21.640 --> 35:23.240
Should I have Mr. Sang

35:23.320 --> 35:24.920
go to your home and create trouble?

35:25.840 --> 35:27.440
- Come on. Let's go home.
- Gui!

35:28.880 --> 35:30.680
Sir! Sir,

35:31.200 --> 35:33.720
I accidentally broke a bowl earlier

35:33.800 --> 35:35.120
and don't have enough money with me.

35:35.200 --> 35:37.120
Could I trouble you to pay for it
on my behalf?

35:38.720 --> 35:40.000
If it's inconvenient for you,

35:40.520 --> 35:42.440
I'll have to ask Mr. Sang

35:42.520 --> 35:43.960
to come back and pay it for me.

35:53.160 --> 35:54.000
Thank you.

36:00.000 --> 36:00.880
Ms. Ji,

36:01.400 --> 36:02.560
every action has its cause.

36:02.640 --> 36:05.080
If Mr. Hua hadn't mentioned
the beauty of the view

36:05.160 --> 36:06.320
at Huanhua Creek,

36:06.400 --> 36:08.760
Shisi wouldn't have insisted
to welcome me there,

36:09.400 --> 36:10.600
and none of this misunderstanding
would have occurred.

36:10.680 --> 36:12.120
The Hua family?

36:13.920 --> 36:15.000
No surprise there.

36:15.960 --> 36:17.120
In that case,

36:17.200 --> 36:19.760
I'll have to trouble you
to speak with Mr. Sang

36:19.840 --> 36:21.520
so he doesn't hold anything
against us folks from Sandaoyan.

36:22.960 --> 36:23.840
What do I get out of it?

36:27.800 --> 36:30.160
Good things come to those who do good!

36:30.960 --> 36:32.360
The speed that it dries…

36:32.440 --> 36:33.600
This color…

36:33.680 --> 36:36.080
Is that dye on your forehead?

36:36.960 --> 36:37.960
You've got guts

36:38.040 --> 36:39.520
tricking Mr. Sang like that.

36:40.600 --> 36:42.520
What do you want?

36:43.760 --> 36:44.960
I lent you a hand.

36:45.040 --> 36:47.360
The least you can do
is invite me for a drink.

36:48.360 --> 36:49.360
Deal. Please, step inside.

36:51.320 --> 36:52.400
Hold on!

37:02.160 --> 37:03.960
Sir, here's your water.

37:06.560 --> 37:07.720
You want me to drink here?

37:08.480 --> 37:09.400
It's my family's rules.

37:09.480 --> 37:11.040
It's custom to have a drink
once you're inside.

37:12.600 --> 37:13.440
Okay.

37:22.080 --> 37:22.920
Alright.

37:23.440 --> 37:25.800
We're square. Please leave.

37:26.640 --> 37:27.760
I haven't got in.

37:28.480 --> 37:30.480
You wanted to come in. I let you.

37:30.560 --> 37:32.880
You wanted a drink. I poured you one.

37:32.960 --> 37:35.320
Thanks for your assistance.
Pardon me for not seeing you out.

37:35.400 --> 37:36.880
Wait! I helped you!

37:36.960 --> 37:38.200
Thank you.

37:40.480 --> 37:41.760
Thank you for your help.

37:43.360 --> 37:44.240
Ms. Ji?

37:44.760 --> 37:46.640
Ms. Ji! Hey!

37:47.160 --> 37:48.960
You left me outside!

37:49.640 --> 37:50.480
Ms. Ji!

38:01.200 --> 38:02.480
Slow down, Mother.

38:04.840 --> 38:05.720
Stand right there!

38:08.280 --> 38:09.120
Mother!

38:09.200 --> 38:11.120
I didn't get into a fight.
I really didn't!

38:13.040 --> 38:14.120
- You…
- Yingying,

38:14.200 --> 38:15.080
you're injured!

38:16.520 --> 38:18.760
Oh no. No! It's fake!

38:18.840 --> 38:20.360
I'm not hurt at all.

38:21.920 --> 38:22.920
It's fake?

38:28.960 --> 38:30.640
See?

38:33.360 --> 38:34.280
So?

38:34.360 --> 38:35.600
I can't scold you because it's fake?

38:36.760 --> 38:38.680
But that's the only way I could fool them.

38:38.760 --> 38:40.880
They all believe this is real.

38:40.960 --> 38:43.160
Mother, Sang Shisi came here

38:43.240 --> 38:44.480
because Mrs. Hua provoked him.

38:44.560 --> 38:46.160
Even if Sang Shisi is willing
to let it go,

38:46.240 --> 38:47.440
Mrs. Hua won't let this slide.

38:47.520 --> 38:49.840
Yaoting, we must come up with a plan
to deal with her.

38:50.520 --> 38:53.080
Ji Yingying! Can't you just let this be?

38:53.800 --> 38:56.440
Must you always fight everything
because of your nature?

38:56.960 --> 38:59.720
Mrs. Hua dominates the market
with no shame,

38:59.800 --> 39:02.200
yet she targets us specifically. Why?

39:02.280 --> 39:04.880
You think I'm the cause of all this?

39:04.960 --> 39:08.240
Because I wouldn't submit,
that's why they are out to get us?

39:08.760 --> 39:11.800
- You think that I'm wrong?
- How many times have I told you?

39:12.480 --> 39:16.200
I only want our family
to have a peaceful and stable life.

39:16.280 --> 39:18.280
Even if we face bullying and losses,

39:18.360 --> 39:20.360
as long as there's no further trouble,
it's already a blessing enough.

39:20.440 --> 39:22.920
Am I wrong to wish for this?

40:14.320 --> 40:16.160
BROCADE OFFICER HERE LIES SHEN HEFENG

40:46.960 --> 40:48.560
Listen up!

40:49.400 --> 40:51.000
From today onward,

40:51.080 --> 40:56.080
whether it's day or night,

40:56.160 --> 40:57.440
that troublemaker

40:57.520 --> 40:59.680
is forbidden

40:59.760 --> 41:01.360
from washing silk in Huanhua Creek!

41:02.800 --> 41:04.080
Mr. Hua,

41:04.600 --> 41:05.960
everyone knows

41:06.040 --> 41:08.960
that only the Shu brocade
washed in this creek

41:09.040 --> 41:10.600
achieves its vibrant color.

41:10.680 --> 41:12.440
That's the only way
to create true Shu brocade.

41:12.520 --> 41:14.960
Huanhua Creek
is the backbone of every dyehouse!

41:15.040 --> 41:16.800
I don't know what I've done to offend you

41:16.880 --> 41:18.440
to ruin my business like this.

41:19.480 --> 41:20.640
You didn't offend me.

41:20.720 --> 41:24.000
You offended Mr. Sang!
